{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13225510","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13225510","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322551001:1":{"text":"죄, 죄인들아. 감히 우리가 영혼과 소통하는 “강령”을 방해하다니! 위대한 의지께서 너희를 벌할 것이다!","source_cn":"你……你们这些罪人，居然敢阻止我们和灵魂沟通“降灵”！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79FB9140D06FF46D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322551002:1":{"text":"위대한 의지시여! 당신의 신도를 해치는 자들에게 벌을 내려주소서!","source_cn":"伟大意志啊！请求您降罪于这些伤害您忠诚信徒的人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFE32BB3151DACEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322551003:1":{"text":"이들과는 대화가 통하지 않을 것 같아요... 그냥 붙잡아서 가두는 게 좋겠어요.","source_cn":"看来和他们是无法正常沟通的……咱们还是把这些人押回去吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5EDF8993E010AF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:顽固的邪教徒":{"text":"완고한 이교도","source":"顽固的邪教徒","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}